---
title: "auto_deleverage_liquidation (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_pre_check: pre_liquidation_check(app, cap, market, adl)
    q_pre_check --> q_load_adl: load ADL timelock params
    q_load_adl --> q_check_type: ADL type?
    q_check_type --> q_debt_adl: ADLBorrow (debt-side)
    q_check_type --> q_col_adl: ADLCollateral (collateral-side)
    q_debt_adl --> q_accrue_debt: accrue_interest for debt asset
    q_accrue_debt --> q_check_debt_breach: total_debt > target_amount?
    q_check_debt_breach --> q_error_within: total_debt <= target_amount
    q_check_debt_breach --> q_calc_debt_params: total_debt > target_amount
    q_error_within --> [*]: abort adl_within_limit
    q_calc_debt_params --> q_liq_inner: liquidation_ltv = base - hourly_drop * hours
    q_col_adl --> q_accrue_col: accrue_interest for collateral asset
    q_accrue_col --> q_check_col_breach: total_deposit > target_amount?
    q_check_col_breach --> q_error_within_col: total_deposit <= target_amount
    q_check_col_breach --> q_calc_col_params: total_deposit > target_amount
    q_error_within_col --> [*]: abort adl_within_limit
    q_calc_col_params --> q_liq_inner: liquidation_ltv = base - hourly_drop * hours
    q_liq_inner --> q_calc_incentive: incentive = base + daily_penalty * days
    q_calc_incentive --> q_cap_incentive: incentive = min(adl_incentive, normal_incentive)
    q_cap_incentive --> q_liquidation: liquidation_inner() with ADL params
    q_liquidation --> q_try_stop: try_stop_borrow/collateral_deleverage()
    q_try_stop --> [*]: return (collateral, refund)

    note right of q_liq_inner
        INV-001: ADL liquidation_ltv decreases over time (hourly_drop)
        INV-002: ADL liquidation_incentive increases over time (daily_penalty)
        INV-003: ADL incentive capped at normal liquidation_incentive
        INV-004: ADL liquidation_revenue_factor = 0 (no protocol cut)
        INV-005: ADL auto-deactivates when metric drops below target_amount
        INV-006: ADL requires explicit admin activation with timelock
    end note
